/** Game landing pages for the tools that are not in the Studio yet: Pixel Lab, Texture Lab, UI Lab,
 * the Tile Lab stages the Studio does not cover, and the classic Sprite Lab's frame export.
 * Their primary action hands the files to the Lab page at <route>/app/ (a Tile/Sprite Lab page at
 * <route>/classic/) until the Studio workspace for them ships; then `target` becomes 'studio'.
 *
 * Every claim rests on docs/PIXEL-LAB.md, docs/TEXTURE-LAB.md, docs/UI-LAB.md and docs/TILE-LAB.md
 * and on the checks in tests/game-landing-browser.py (part 4, Chromium and Firefox). Engine import of
 * these outputs was NOT run anywhere and the pages say so. Dependency-free. */
const L=(en,ko,ja)=>({en,ko,ja});

